('contact-us','Contact Firefly Heating & Cooling','Tell us what is happening.','Call Firefly at (614) 363-9941 for urgent service. For non-urgent questions, prepare an enquiry with your address, system and preferred contact method.','contact HVAC company Columbus OH','comfort',['For urgent heating or cooling failures, call rather than waiting for a form. For planned work, include your neighborhood, equipment type, symptoms or project goal and a convenient time to talk.','The address provided for this project differs from the address published on the original site, so this preview does not list a street address until the owner confirms it.','On the GitHub Pages preview, the form prepares a text to Firefly in your messaging app. You must press Send there. On a Node.js host the bundled first-party handler can securely save submissions to a private owner inbox without a third-party form service.'],['Phone for emergencies','Clear request details','No unverified street address'],('What is Firefly’s phone number?','Call (614) 363-9941. For an urgent issue, always call directly.')),
('faq','HVAC Questions & Answers','Answers before the appointment.','Practical answers to common Columbus HVAC questions about repairs, heat pumps, filters, ductless systems and emergency scheduling.','Columbus HVAC FAQ','thermostat',['A useful service call starts with what you observe: the equipment type, the symptom, when it began and the address. A photograph of the model label can help if it is safe to access.','The answer to repair versus replacement depends on equipment condition, scope, cost and your comfort goals. A diagnosis should come first.','If the situation involves gas, suspected carbon monoxide or a dangerous electrical condition, leave the area and contact emergency services or the utility. A web form is not an emergency line.'],['Repair or replacement','Filter and thermostat questions','Emergency contact route'],('How do I request service?','Call (614) 363-9941, or use the contact page for a non-urgent enquiry.')),
('privacy','Privacy & Enquiry Handling','A clear preview privacy note.','This demonstration website does not use analytics or tracking cookies. Its browser-based form is explained before submission.','Firefly website privacy','comfort',['This is a demonstration prepared for the business owner, not the company’s final legal privacy policy. Do not treat it as a substitute for review by the owner.','In the GitHub Pages preview, form content stays in the visitor’s browser until the visitor opens a messaging app; GitHub Pages does not receive form submissions. The visitor must tap Send in the messaging app.','On Node.js hosting, the bundled handler saves form submissions to a private local JSON Lines file and provides an owner-only inbox. The owner must set an admin password and choose their retention and access policy before launch.'],['No analytics on this preview','Text-message draft on static hosting','Owner review required before launch'],('Is my form sent automatically on GitHub Pages?','No. The static preview prepares a text message in your messaging app; you must send it there.')),
('accessibility','Accessibility Information','A site designed for more people.','This preview uses semantic HTML, keyboard-friendly navigation, visible focus states and responsive layouts. Let the owner know if an accessibility issue needs attention.','Firefly accessibility information','comfort',['Use the skip link at the top of every page to move directly to main content. Navigation and forms are available with a keyboard and labels are attached to fields.','Images have descriptive alternative text where they convey information, while decorative elements are hidden from assistive technology. Motion is reduced when your device requests it.','This is a design statement, not a certification of conformance. If an experience is not usable for you, call (614) 363-9941 so the team can help directly.'],['Keyboard navigation','Readable responsive layout','Direct phone alternative'],('How can I report a problem?','Call (614) 363-9941 and describe the page and issue.')),
